{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-rings","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-rings","about":"Discover The Rings Dubai Water Canal, an extraordinary waterfront development by PMR Property. Nestled gracefully along the serene Dubai Water Canal, The Rings by PMR presents opulent living in two distinct structures.Within each mansion, lavish residences ranging from 9,500 sq. ft., to 19,800 sq. ft., await. Available as 5 and 6-bedroom duplexes and 6 to 7-bedroom triplexes, these homes redefine luxury living with private swimming pools, elevators, gyms, cinemas, extensive garden terraces, and floor-to-ceiling windows. Residents enjoy sweeping 180-degree views of both the Dubai Water Canal and the iconic Burj Khalifa.Upon entering The Rings, a grand double-height lobby surrounded by tranquil reflective pools sets the stage for a truly immersive experience. Convenience reaches new heights with personalized underground parking pods, complete with a private car showroom and lifts that seamlessly connect to the residential units.Welcome to The Rings at Jumeirah, where sophistication, sustainability, and an elevated lifestyle converge along the enchanting Dubai Water Canal.","price":59000000,"title":"The Rings","bitrix":{"id":322,"pf_id":"are.3.13528","source":null,"project_id":"Jumeirah 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Rings","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"PMR Property","project_location":"Jumeirah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_rings_feature_73ab0c8960.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_rings_feature_73ab0c8960.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1482151,"lng":55.2828264},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/the_rings_1_c2eb5ecccd.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/the_rings_1_c2eb5ecccd.w